{"id":"n70752-1-8","stage":1,"title":"이전 · 以前","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70752-1-8-1","ko":"너는 왜 여행을 싫어하니?","zh":"你为什么不喜欢旅行呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"여행을","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여행을","audio":"/audio/8e4d1a5a7460b5dcfa6a.mp3"}},{"text":"싫어하니?","meaning":"讨厌，不愿意","explanation":"싫어하다：讨厌，不愿意；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"싫어하다","audio":"/audio/1a00f3250955b45e9391.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64963","senseId":"1","lemma":"싫어하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싫어하니","audio":"/audio/dc7c1a96321050f5774f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"1a00f3250955b45e","term":"싫어하다","zh":"讨厌，不愿意","audio":"/audio/1a00f3250955b45e9391.mp3","entryId":"64963","definition":"不合心意或不想要。","pronunciation":["시러하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5f704fd60bcb146b78b0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70752-1-8-2","ko":"이전의 여행 경험들이 다 좋지 않았거든.","zh":"因为之前的旅行经历都不太好啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이전의","meaning":"以前，之前","explanation":"이전：以前，之前；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"이전","audio":"/audio/da7e61c67cc5a90f0630.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70752","senseId":"1","lemma":"이전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이전의","audio":"/audio/4139c683ecda37f61ddd.mp3"}},{"text":"여행","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}},{"text":"경험들이","meaning":"经验","explanation":"경험：经验；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"경험","audio":"/audio/340b9a0fcd5fc1d6bfa3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26087","senseId":"1","lemma":"경험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경험들이","audio":"/audio/d4636b296212fe72470e.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"좋지","meaning":"好、愉快","explanation":"좋지 않았다 是“并不好”；这里指过去的旅行经历不愉快，并非“态度温柔”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋지","audio":"/audio/93fe8dafc60040a28c9b.mp3"}},{"text":"않았거든.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않았거든","audio":"/audio/dfe6f1cd96a17922451e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da7e61c67cc5a90f","term":"이전","zh":"以前，之前","audio":"/audio/da7e61c67cc5a90f0630.mp3","entryId":"70752","definition":"比现在往前。","pronunciation":["이ː전"]},{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"340b9a0fcd5fc1d6","term":"경험","zh":"经验","audio":"/audio/340b9a0fcd5fc1d6bfa3.mp3","entryId":"26087","definition":"自己实际做过或经历过；或指从中获得的知识或技能。","pronunciation":["경험"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好、令人满意","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"旅行经历令人满意；在否定式 좋지 않았다 中表示体验不好。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/86a107e8ed763b4b43ab.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.858,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70752","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":32,"sequenceScore":1.4101,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你为什么不喜欢旅行呢？","因为之前的旅行经历都不太好啊。","承奎，你今天为什么上学迟到了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你为什么不喜欢旅行呢？","因为之前的旅行经历都不太好啊。","承奎，你今天为什么上学迟到了？"],"answer":1}]}
